<div id="urduTextPath">مولا عباس (ع)/اہلِ حرم کا مونس و غم خوار مر گیا</div>
<br>Ahl-E- Haram Ka Monis-O-Ghamkhaar Margaya<br>
Wo Zor-E- Baazu-E Shah-E- Abraar Margaya<br>
Hae Hae Nashaan-E- Hyder-E- Karrar Margaya<br>
Lashkar Huwa Tamaam Alamdar Margaya<br>
 <br>
Sarf-E- Buka Haram Me Shah-E- Mashraqain Ke<br>
Rote Hain Kooze Phaink Ke Bacche Hussain Ke<br>
____________________________<br>
Maara Gaya Taraai Pa Hyder Ka Laadla<br>
Shaanoun Se Haae Dast-E- Mubaarak Huwe Juda<br>
Paiwast ek Aankh Me Teer-E- Jafaa Huwa<br>
Sar Gurz Aahni Se Hai Shaq Waa Musibata<br>
 <br>
Aisi Kisi Shaheed Pa Guzri Jafaa Nahi<br>
Girte Hain Zee'n Se Haathoun Ka Bhi Aasra Nahi<br>
____________________________<br>
Kyu Ro rahe Ho Aye Pisar-E- Shah-E- Mashraqain<br>
Kya Guzri Khalb-E- Zaar Pa Hyder Ke Noor-E- Ain<br>
Kuch To Kaho Zabaan Se Dil ko nahi Hai Chain<br>
Aaya Hai Dekho Laash Pa Bhaai Teraa Hussain<br>
 <br>
Is Bekasi Me Jaate Ho Mu Apna Mod Ke<br>
Ghurbath Me Kispe Jaate Ho Bhaai Ko Chodh Ke<br>
____________________________<br>
Phir Roke Bole Shaah Ke Qadmoun Pa Rakh Ke Sar<br>
Hai Arz Ye Ghulaam Ki Ya Syedul Bashar<br>
Sharminda Hai Sakina Se Abbas-E- Naamwar<br>
Laasha Hamara Leke Na Jaae'n Qayaam Par<br>
 <br>
Qaadim Ko Rahne Dijiye Aaqa Lab-E- Furaath<br>
Maskan Rahe Ghulaam Ka Moula Lab-E- Furaath<br>
____________________________<br>
Ye Kehte The Hussain Se Abbas-E- Nekh Naam<br>
Hichki Ek Aai Ghash Ne Diya Mout Ka Payaam<br>
Aankhen Jhuka Ke Sheh Ko Kiya Aaqri Salaam<br>
Haathoun Se Dil Ko Thaam Liya Sarwar-E- Anaam<br>
 <br>
Ghurbath Me Shah-E- Deen Ko Be Aas Kar Gaye<br>
Tanha Hussain Hogaye Abbas Margaye<br>
____________________________<br>
Sar Uth Ke Peet-Te The Shainshaah-E- Do Jahaa'n<br>
Sheh Ko Sambhaalte The Ali Akbar-E Jawaa'n<br>
Kehe The Roke Bete Se Ye Sarwar-E- Zamaa'n<br>
Abbas Ham Ko Chod Gaye Aye Pidar Ki Jaan<br>
 <br>
Kis Se Kahe Jo Guzra Hai Sadma Hussain Par<br>
Dard-O- Alam Ka Aasmaa'n Toota Hussain Par<br>
____________________________<br>
Aye Ibn-E- Fatema Ke Fidaai Uttho Uttho<br>
Kaisi Tumhe Ye Neend Hai Aayi Uttho Uttho<br>
Kyun Tum Ne Ki Pasand Taraai Uttho Uttho<br>
Bhaai Uttho Uttho Mere Bhaai Uttho Uttho<br>
 <br>
Labbaik Kehke Aate Nahi Ibn-E- Buturaab<br>
Aawaaz Par Hussain Ki Dete Nahi Jawaab<br>
____________________________<br>
Bhaai Bataao Qaime me Jaakar Mai Kya Kahoo'n<br>
Be-Chain Hongi Aal-E- Payambar Mai Kya Kahoo'n<br>
Nanhi Sakina Se Aye Baradar Mai Kya Kahoo'n<br>
Pooche Mujhe Jo Zainab-E- Muztar Mai Kya Kahoo'n<br>
 <br>
Kaise Kahoo'n Taraai Pa Shabbir Lut Gaya<br>
Abbas Ka Hussain Se Saath Aaj Chut Gaya<br>
____________________________<br>
Ye Kehke Naher Se Chale Rote Huwe Imaam<br>
Akbar Ne Mashk Aur Alam Ko Liya Tha Thaam<br>
Pahonche Dar-E- Qiyaam Pa Jis Dam Shah-E- Anaam<br>
Bhaai Se Lipti Doudh Ke Zainab Falak Maqaam<br>
 <br>
Kehti Thi Kyu Alam Hai Ye Khoo'n Me Bhara Huwa<br>
Batlaao Bhaai Jaa'n Mera Abbas Kya Huwa<br>
____________________________<br>
Zainab Se Tab Ye Kehne Lage Shah-E- Karbala<br>
Hai Hai Ali Ke Sher Ke Baazu Huwe Judaa<br>
Teer-E- Sitam Se Mashk Chidi Paani Behgaya<br>
Maara Gaya Furaat Pa Saqqa Sakina Ka<br>
 <br>
Zainab Wo Mera Quwwat e Baazu Guzar Gaya<br>
Abbas Qatl Kya Huwe Shabbir Margaya<br>
____________________________<br>
Sun Sun Ke Sab Hussain Ki Guftaar Sakina<br>
Lipti Pidar Se Aake Dilafgaar Sakina<br>
Kehte The Shaah Ammu Ki Ghamqwhaar Sakina<br>
Maare Gaye Darya Pa Alamdar Sakina<br>
 <br>
Kaisee Bataaun Unpa Mai Kya Kya Sitam Huwe<br>
Darya Pa Tere Ammu Ke Shaane Qalam Huwe<br>
____________________________<br>
Momin Bapaa Hae Maatam-E- Abbas-E- Qushqisaal<br>
Zere Alam Hain Jamma Haram Khole Sar Ke Baal<br>
Sar Peet-Te Hai Aal-E- Payambar Basad Malaal<br>
Kehte The Shaah Ab Mera Jeena Huwa Mohaal<br>
 <br>
Shaane Kataake Sogaya Saqqa Taraai Me<br>
Rassi Bandhegi Bint-E- Ali Ki Kalhaai Me.